    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83e\udd95 CHECK OUT THE DINO PARK WITH THE KITTIES!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>\ud83e\udd16 DIVE INTO THE ADVENTURE WITH ROBO CATS!</h1><p></p><br><h1>\u2744\ufe0f DIVE INTO WINTER ADVENTURE WITH CATS!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc7d This time the cats find themselves in space on an alien planet. Find 100 hidden kitties here - for free!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881900/extras/4c9b8f6513f5770d7bd7d7812a3b1fd9.poster.avif?t=1740824365\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881900/extras/4c9b8f6513f5770d7bd7d7812a3b1fd9.webm?t=1740824365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881900/extras/4c9b8f6513f5770d7bd7d7812a3b1fd9.mp4?t=1740824365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf08 Paint them in your favorite colors by simply clicking on them. You can choose a color in the pause menu.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881900/extras/ccb03b2550cadb807b52fd181461d65a.poster.avif?t=1740824365\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881900/extras/ccb03b2550cadb807b52fd181461d65a.webm?t=1740824365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881900/extras/ccb03b2550cadb807b52fd181461d65a.mp4?t=1740824365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf12 Negative mod